<attribute name="refinedDescription" nodeId="7bcafef1">&lt;ul&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        Identify all stakeholders and group into workshops based on knowledge of cutover process.
    &lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        Confirm receipt of the plan.
    &lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        Conduct line-by-line walk-through of cutover and deployment plan.
    &lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        Document any issues and risks raised in the walk-through.
    &lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        Address questions and issues raised.
    &lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        Develop mitigation process for any risks identified.
    &lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        Update project plan.
    &lt;/li&gt;
